{"seq":2,"slug":"container-orchestration","title":"容器与编排","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/software-technology/cloud-devops/container-orchestration","wordCount":893,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"容器与编排\">容器与编排</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>容器技术彻底改变了软件的打包和部署方式——&quot;在我机器上能跑&quot;不再是问题，因为应用及其所有依赖被封装在标准化的容器镜像中。Docker 实现了单机容器化，Kubernetes（K8s）则解决了大规模容器的编排和管理问题。2026 年容器化已成为企业级应用部署的默认选择。</p>\n<h3 id=\"docker-核心概念\">Docker 核心概念</h3><p>Docker 的三个核心组件：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>类比</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>镜像 (Image)</td>\n<td>只读模板，包含运行所需的一切</td>\n<td>类 (Class)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>容器 (Container)</td>\n<td>镜像的运行实例</td>\n<td>对象 (Instance)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>仓库 (Registry)</td>\n<td>存储和分发镜像</td>\n<td>Maven 仓库</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"dockerfile-与镜像构建\">Dockerfile 与镜像构建</h3><p>Dockerfile 是构建镜像的&quot;配方&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dockerfile\" data-code=\"# 多阶段构建 — 缩小最终镜像体积&#10;FROM maven:3.9-eclipse-temurin-21 AS builder&#10;WORKDIR /app&#10;COPY pom.xml .&#10;RUN mvn dependency:go-offline&#10;COPY src/ src/&#10;RUN mvn package -DskipTests&#10;&#10;FROM eclipse-temurin:21-jre-alpine&#10;WORKDIR /app&#10;COPY --from=builder /app/target/myapp.jar app.jar&#10;&#10;# 非 root 用户运行&#10;RUN addgroup -S appgroup &amp;&amp; adduser -S appuser -G appgroup&#10;USER appuser&#10;&#10;EXPOSE 8080&#10;ENTRYPOINT [&quot;java&quot;, &quot;-Xmx256m&quot;, &quot;-jar&quot;, &quot;app.jar&quot;]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 多阶段构建 — 缩小最终镜像体积</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>FROM maven:3.9-eclipse-temurin-21 AS builder</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WORKDIR /app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>COPY pom.xml .</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RUN mvn dependency:go-offline</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>COPY src/ src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RUN mvn package -DskipTests</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>FROM eclipse-temurin:21-jre-alpine</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WORKDIR /app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>COPY --from=builder /app/target/myapp.jar app.jar</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 非 root 用户运行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RUN addgroup -S appgroup &#x26;&#x26; adduser -S appuser -G appgroup</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>USER appuser</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>EXPOSE 8080</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ENTRYPOINT [\"java\", \"-Xmx256m\", \"-jar\", \"app.jar\"]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>镜像优化策略：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>多阶段构建：编译环境不进入最终镜像</li>\n<li>使用 Alpine 基础镜像：从 ~300MB 缩减到 ~80MB</li>\n<li>层缓存利用：不常变化的依赖放在前面</li>\n<li><code>.dockerignore</code> 排除不需要的文件</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 构建与运行&#10;docker build -t myapp:1.0 .&#10;docker run -d -p 8080:8080 --name myapp myapp:1.0&#10;docker logs -f myapp\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 构建与运行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -t</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> myapp:1.0</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -p</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 8080:8080</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --name</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> myapp</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> myapp:1.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> logs</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> myapp</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"docker-compose-多容器编排\">Docker Compose 多容器编排</h3><p>真实应用通常由多个服务组成（应用 + 数据库 + 缓存），Compose 用 YAML 定义多容器环境：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# docker-compose.yml&#10;version: &#39;3.8&#39;&#10;services:&#10;  app:&#10;    build: .&#10;    ports:&#10;      - &#39;8080:8080&#39;&#10;    environment:&#10;      - SPRING_DATASOURCE_URL=jdbc:mysql://db:3306/myapp&#10;      - SPRING_REDIS_HOST=redis&#10;    depends_on:&#10;      db:&#10;        condition: service_healthy&#10;      redis:&#10;        condition: service_started&#10;&#10;  db:&#10;    image: mysql:8.0&#10;    environment:&#10;      MYSQL_ROOT_PASSWORD: root123&#10;      MYSQL_DATABASE: myapp&#10;    volumes:&#10;      - mysql_data:/var/lib/mysql&#10;      - ./init.sql:/docker-entrypoint-initdb.d/init.sql&#10;    healthcheck:&#10;      test: [&#39;CMD&#39;, &#39;mysqladmin&#39;, &#39;ping&#39;, &#39;-h&#39;, &#39;localhost&#39;]&#10;      interval: 10s&#10;      timeout: 5s&#10;      retries: 3&#10;&#10;  redis:&#10;    image: redis:7-alpine&#10;    ports:&#10;      - &#39;6379:6379&#39;&#10;&#10;volumes:&#10;  mysql_data:\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># docker-compose.yml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'3.8'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">services</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  app</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    build</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    ports</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'8080:8080'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    environment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SPRING_DATASOURCE_URL=jdbc:mysql://db:3306/myapp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SPRING_REDIS_HOST=redis</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    depends_on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      db</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        condition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">service_healthy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      redis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        condition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">service_started</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  db</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">mysql:8.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    environment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      MYSQL_ROOT_PASSWORD</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">root123</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      MYSQL_DATABASE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">myapp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    volumes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">mysql_data:/var/lib/mysql</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">./init.sql:/docker-entrypoint-initdb.d/init.sql</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    healthcheck</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CMD'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'mysqladmin'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ping'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'-h'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'localhost'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      interval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">10s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      timeout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">5s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      retries</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  redis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">redis:7-alpine</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    ports</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'6379:6379'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">volumes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  mysql_data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"docker compose up -d        # 启动所有服务&#10;docker compose logs -f app  # 查看应用日志&#10;docker compose down -v      # 停止并清理\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> up</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 启动所有服务</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> logs</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> app</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 查看应用日志</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> down</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -v</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      # 停止并清理</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"kubernetes-核心架构\">Kubernetes 核心架构</h3><p>K8s 将容器集群抽象为声明式资源管理系统：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph &quot;控制平面&quot;&#10;        A[&quot;API Server&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;etcd&quot;]&#10;        A --&gt; C[&quot;Scheduler&quot;]&#10;        A --&gt; D[&quot;Controller Manager&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;工作节点&quot;&#10;        E[&quot;kubelet&quot;] --&gt; F[&quot;Pod&quot;]&#10;        E --&gt; G[&quot;Pod&quot;]&#10;        H[&quot;kube-proxy&quot;] --&gt; I[&quot;Service&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    A --&gt; E\">graph TB\n    subgraph \"控制平面\"\n        A[\"API Server\"] --&gt; B[\"etcd\"]\n        A --&gt; C[\"Scheduler\"]\n        A --&gt; D[\"Controller Manager\"]\n    end\n    subgraph \"工作节点\"\n        E[\"kubelet\"] --&gt; F[\"Pod\"]\n        E --&gt; G[\"Pod\"]\n        H[\"kube-proxy\"] --&gt; I[\"Service\"]\n    end\n    A --&gt; E</pre><p>核心资源对象：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>资源</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Pod</td>\n<td>最小调度单位，一个或多个容器</td>\n<td>运行一个 Java 应用容器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Deployment</td>\n<td>声明式管理 Pod 副本数和更新策略</td>\n<td>保持 3 个副本运行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Service</td>\n<td>稳定的网络入口，负载均衡</td>\n<td>暴露 HTTP 端口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ConfigMap</td>\n<td>配置数据注入</td>\n<td>数据库连接字符串</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Secret</td>\n<td>敏感信息管理</td>\n<td>密码、密钥</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HPA</td>\n<td>自动水平扩缩容</td>\n<td>CPU &gt; 70% 时扩容</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"k8s-部署实战\">K8s 部署实战</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# deployment.yaml&#10;apiVersion: apps/v1&#10;kind: Deployment&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: myapp&#10;  labels:&#10;    app: myapp&#10;spec:&#10;  replicas: 3&#10;  selector:&#10;    matchLabels:&#10;      app: myapp&#10;  template:&#10;    metadata:&#10;      labels:&#10;        app: myapp&#10;    spec:&#10;      containers:&#10;        - name: myapp&#10;          image: registry.example.com/myapp:1.0&#10;          ports:&#10;            - containerPort: 8080&#10;          resources:&#10;            requests:&#10;              memory: &#39;256Mi&#39;&#10;              cpu: &#39;200m&#39;&#10;            limits:&#10;              memory: &#39;512Mi&#39;&#10;              cpu: &#39;500m&#39;&#10;          livenessProbe:&#10;            httpGet:&#10;              path: /actuator/health&#10;              port: 8080&#10;            initialDelaySeconds: 30&#10;            periodSeconds: 10&#10;          readinessProbe:&#10;            httpGet:&#10;              path: /actuator/health/readiness&#10;              port: 8080&#10;            initialDelaySeconds: 10&#10;            periodSeconds: 5&#10;---&#10;apiVersion: v1&#10;kind: Service&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: myapp-svc&#10;spec:&#10;  selector:&#10;    app: myapp&#10;  ports:&#10;    - port: 80&#10;      targetPort: 8080&#10;  type: ClusterIP&#10;---&#10;apiVersion: autoscaling/v2&#10;kind: HorizontalPodAutoscaler&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: myapp-hpa&#10;spec:&#10;  scaleTargetRef:&#10;    apiVersion: apps/v1&#10;    kind: Deployment&#10;    name: myapp&#10;  minReplicas: 2&#10;  maxReplicas: 10&#10;  metrics:&#10;    - type: Resource&#10;      resource:&#10;        name: cpu&#10;        target:&#10;          type: Utilization&#10;          averageUtilization: 70\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=