">Utilization</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          averageUtilization</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">70</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"kubectl apply -f deployment.yaml&#10;kubectl get pods -w                    # 观察 Pod 启动&#10;kubectl describe pod myapp-xxx        # 查看详情&#10;kubectl logs myapp-xxx -f             # 查看日志&#10;kubectl rollout restart deploy/myapp  # 滚动重启\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> apply</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> deployment.yaml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> get</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pods</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -w</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                    # 观察 Pod 启动</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> describe</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pod</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> myapp-xxx</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 查看详情</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> logs</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> myapp-xxx</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">             # 查看日志</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rollout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> restart</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> deploy/myapp</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 滚动重启</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"滚动更新与回滚\">滚动更新与回滚</h3><p>K8s 默认采用滚动更新策略，新版本 Pod 逐步替换旧版本，保证服务不中断：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"spec:&#10;  strategy:&#10;    type: RollingUpdate&#10;    rollingUpdate:&#10;      maxSurge: 1 # 最多多出1个Pod&#10;      maxUnavailable: 0 # 不允许不可用Pod\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  strategy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">RollingUpdate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    rollingUpdate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      maxSurge</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 最多多出1个Pod</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      maxUnavailable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 不允许不可用Pod</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 更新镜像版本&#10;kubectl set image deploy/myapp myapp=registry.example.com/myapp:2.0&#10;&#10;# 发现问题立即回滚&#10;kubectl rollout undo deploy/myapp&#10;kubectl rollout history deploy/myapp  # 查看历史版本\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 更新镜像版本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> set</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> image</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> deploy/myapp</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> myapp=registry.example.com/myapp:2.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 发现问题立即回滚</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rollout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> undo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> deploy/myapp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rollout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> history</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> deploy/myapp</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 查看历史版本</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Kubernetes 1.30+ Gateway API</strong>：取代 Ingress 成为流量管理的标准 API，支持更细粒度的路由规则</li>\n<li><strong>WebAssembly (Wasm) 容器</strong>：比传统容器启动更快、体积更小，SpinKube 项目让 Wasm 工作负载原生运行在 K8s 上</li>\n<li><strong>GitOps 成为标准</strong>：ArgoCD/Flux 监听 Git 仓库变化，自动将集群状态同步为代码声明的状态</li>\n<li><strong>AI 驱动的 K8s 运维</strong>：Kubernetes Copilot 类工具可根据自然语言生成 YAML 配置、排查 Pod 故障</li>\n<li><strong>Serverless Container</strong>：阿里云 ASK、AWS Fargate 等无服务器容器平台消除了节点管理负担</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>为你的 Spring Boot 项目编写 Dockerfile（多阶段构建），构建镜像后使用 Docker Compose 搭建完整的开发环境（App + MySQL + Redis），验证各服务间网络连通性。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>使用 Minikube 或 Kind 搭建本地 K8s 集群，将上述应用部署为 3 副本 Deployment + Service，配置 HPA 使 CPU 使用率超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>70</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">70\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">70%</span></span></span></span></span> 时自动扩容至最多 5 个 Pod。使用 <code>kubectl top</code> 验证资源监控。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>模拟滚动发布：将应用从 v1.0 更新到 v2.0，观察更新过程中 Pod 的替换顺序。然后模拟 v2.0 有 Bug（健康检查失败），验证 K8s 是否自动停止更新并可手动回滚。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>容器与编排是云原生架构的基石。Docker 解决了&quot;环境一致性&quot;问题，让应用从开发到生产的交付过程标准化；Kubernetes 解决了&quot;规模化运行&quot;问题，通过声明式配置、自动扩缩容和滚动更新保障了服务的高可用性。掌握 Docker + K8s 的组合，就掌握了 2026 年企业级应用部署的主流方式。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"容器与编排","id":"容器与编排"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"Docker 核心概念","id":"docker-核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"Dockerfile 与镜像构建","id":"dockerfile-与镜像构建"},{"level":3,"text":"Docker Compose 多容器编排","id":"docker-compose-多容器编排"},{"level":3,"text":"Kubernetes 核心架构","id":"kubernetes-核心架构"},{"level":3,"text":"K8s 部署实战","id":"k8s-部署实战"},{"level":3,"text":"滚动更新与回滚","id":"滚动更新与回滚"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Linux 运维","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/software-technology/cloud-devops/linux-administration"},"next":{"title":"AI 辅助开发","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/software-technology/cloud-devops/ai-assisted-development"}}